POLITICALLY CORRECT AMERICA
 
by Peter Alan Kasler 
(originally published in American Survival Guide)
 
It is time to divide our country into two separate nations. I 
propose this hoping to avoid the revolution that surely 
approaches, even as you read this.The warring factions in 
the currently-existing United States of America will be the 
enlightened who know what's best for everyone, and those 
sufficiently deluded to believe that they can take care of 
themselves.
 
One of the new nations would be Politically Correct America 
(PCA). Its citizens would have no worries, they'd be able to 
relax and enjoy life, government would take care of them 
and keep them from harm. Individual responsibility would 
become a relic of the past, replaced by absolute equality and 
absolution of blame. 
 
They will, however, be required to wear crash helmets at all 
times, even indoors. Speed limits will be maxed-out at 25 
mph, but not to worry, without internal combustion engines 
no vehicles could top that anyway.
 
The FDA would assume a more prominent role in everyone's 
lives. Prescriptions would be required for such things as 
table salt, white sugar, anything containing caffeine or 
cholesterol, and, of course, protein. In some circumstances 
certain combinations of substances may be permitted in 
limited quantities. Ice cream and red meat would be rationed 
for most people, but denied to those who are overweight or 
otherwise deemed at risk. Twinkies would be a capital 
offense for anyone, regardless of weight, cholesterol level, or 
acne-free complexion.
 
Friendly and courteous, heavily-armed policepersons would 
escort PCA citizens on those rare occasions when they 
actually leave their living units, prior permission having 
been granted of course. Resisting anything for any reason 
would be illegal; a misdemeanor for some, but a felony for 
white, gainfully-employed taxpayers without prior criminal 
records. Having any object that can conceivably be used for 
defense would constitute a felony. As defense would be 
unnecessary in PCA, possession of such implements would 
be indicative of aggressive intent.
 
Schools would be required to give an equal proportion of 
"A"s to all students; few "D"s and no "F"s would be given. 
English classes would be taught in a variety of "native" 
languages from around the world. No tests except those 
certified to be devoid of ethnic-, gender-, age-, intelligence-, 
and class-bias; white male students would be given a 40% 
"opportunity" handicap for scoring purposes, and their test 
results would be lowered one letter grade to compensate for 
the hundreds of years of oppression their forebears 
perpetrated upon the socially-disadvantaged.
 
Hiring and job promotions on the basis of merit would be 
deemed discriminatory. Everyone would be paid equally for 
all jobs, regardless of everything.
 
Because public accommodations and places open to the 
public cannot be made absolutely accessible to the physically 
challenged, all restaurants, stores, museums, sports 
facilities, and public offices would be closed so as to avoid 
discrimination.
 
Smoking indoors in one's own home would be a felony. 
Smoking outdoors or on public land or property would be a 
capital offense. Of course, possession of smoking-related 
materials in any combination would be unlawful, e.g., 
tobacco, matches, cigarette lighters, and lighter fluid. In 
addition, persons found in possession of framistans (those 
little red cellophane strips that one pulls off to open 
cigarette wrappers) would be classified as presumptive 
offenders, having then to prove they have not smoked or 
possessed tobacco products. Rolling papers, on the other 
hand, while suggestive of tobacco-related intent, would be 
deemed to have independent social utility, thus persons 
found in possession thereof would be allowed to offer 
rebuttal evidence that said rolling papers were possessed 
only for use with non-tobacco-dependent activities.
 
Belts and shoelaces would be allowed only when actually 
installed in belt loops and shoe eyelets. Because these items 
facilitate suicide, if not actually encouraging it, persons 
found in possession thereof, used appropriately, would be 
added to the public database of latent violators (PDLV), and 
classified as 3rd Degree Violators (V3). Persons found 
possessing belts and shoelaces not actually installed in belt 
loops and shoe eyelets would be classified as 2nd Degree 
Violators (V2) and considered to be imminent suicide risks. 
Persons identified more than once as V2s would be 
immediately classified as V1s and euthanized to prevent 
them from committing suicide.
 
Naturally, strict border controls would be implemented to 
keep businesses from fleeing to the free market. That 
problem will be short-lived, however, because soon after PCA 
comes into being, privately-owned business will disappear. 
This will occur following implementation of guaranteed 
employment for everyone, which in turn will be 
accomplished by subjugating all entrepreneurs and 
compelling them to operate state-owned businesses that sell 
goods at state-regulated prices.
 
The other new country, uncivilized Self-Reliant America 
(SRA) would be virtually lawless and populated by ruffians, 
the likes of which have not been seen since Teddy Roosevelt. 
Taking great delight in the facts that they are not enslaved 
with debt and taxation, threatened with imprisonment for 
growing natural vegetation or possessing material objects, 
SRA citizens would have but a single law to guide them: you 
injure, you pay.
 
SRA citizens would be free to choose for themselves, to 
behave as they saw fit, delighted to accept responsibility for 
their decisions and their actions.
 
